---
// Diagram 3: the circular financing loop — NVIDIA → neocloud → hyperscaler → back to NVIDIA.
---

<div class="diagram-wrap">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 480" role="img" aria-label="Diagram: NVIDIA invests in a neocloud, the neocloud rents capacity to a hyperscaler, and the hyperscaler's payments flow back to NVIDIA, forming a loop">
    <defs>
      <marker id="arrowhead" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="7" refY="3.5" orient="auto">
        <polygon points="0 0, 8 3.5, 0 7" class="arrow-fill" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- curved loop edges -->
    <path d="M 265,110 C 150,170 120,270 175,330" class="edge" marker-end="url(#arrowhead)" />
    <path d="M 260,352 C 340,392 440,382 480,330" class="edge" marker-end="url(#arrowhead)" />
    <path d="M 500,290 C 480,200 420,130 380,105" class="edge" marker-end="url(#arrowhead)" />

    <!-- edge labels -->
    <text x="128" y="240" text-anchor="middle" class="edge-label">
      <tspan x="128" dy="0">Invests / extends</tspan>
      <tspan x="128" dy="13">financing</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="370" y="400" text-anchor="middle" class="edge-label">
      <tspan x="370" dy="0">Rents GPU capacity</tspan>
      <tspan x="370" dy="13">(multi-year contract)</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="530" y="215" text-anchor="middle" class="edge-label">
      <tspan x="530" dy="0">Buys GPUs /</tspan>
      <tspan x="530" dy="13">revenue flows back</tspan>
    </text>

    <!-- node: NVIDIA (top) -->
    <circle cx="320" cy="70" r="62" class="node" />
    <text x="320" y="64" text-anchor="middle" class="node-title">NVIDIA</text>
    <text x="320" y="82" text-anchor="middle" class="node-sub">chip designer</text>

    <!-- node: Neocloud (bottom left) -->
    <circle cx="155" cy="370" r="62" class="node accent" />
    <text x="155" y="364" text-anchor="middle" class="node-title">Neocloud</text>
    <text x="155" y="382" text-anchor="middle" class="node-sub">e.g. CoreWeave</text>

    <!-- node: Hyperscaler (bottom right) -->
    <circle cx="500" cy="370" r="62" class="node accent" />
    <text x="500" y="364" text-anchor="middle" class="node-title">Hyperscaler</text>
    <text x="500" y="382" text-anchor="middle" class="node-sub">e.g. Microsoft</text>

    <!-- center caption -->
    <text x="320" y="235" text-anchor="middle" class="center-caption">
      <tspan x="320" dy="0">Same pool of capital</tspan>
      <tspan x="320" dy="15">circulates among a</tspan>
      <tspan x="320" dy="15">small group of related</tspan>
      <tspan x="320" dy="15">companies</tspan>
    </text>

    <!-- bottom step 2 note -->
    <text x="320" y="464" text-anchor="middle" class="footnote">Step 2: the neocloud also buys more NVIDIA GPUs directly, often using NVIDIA-chip-backed debt.</text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .diagram-wrap { margin: 1.8em 0 2.2em; }
  svg { width: 100%; height: auto; }

  .node { fill: var(--bg-raised); stroke: var(--border-strong); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .node.accent { fill: var(--accent-dim); stroke: var(--accent-border); }

  .node-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .node-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    fill: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .edge {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--highlight);
    stroke-width: 2.5;
  }
  .arrow-fill { fill: var(--highlight); }

  .edge-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--highlight-strong);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .center-caption {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    fill: var(--text-tertiary);
  }

  .footnote {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    fill: var(--text-tertiary);
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
